    "details": "<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">Welcome to the <strong data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"15\">InternHill Code Sprint</strong>, the premier technical hiring challenge hosted by InternHill Solutions! We are on the lookout for the next generation of bright, innovative software engineering interns to join our rapidly growing development team.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"4\">At InternHill Solutions, we believe in building robust, scalable, and highly efficient digital platforms. This sprint isn't just about solving abstract algorithmic puzzles&mdash;it is designed to test your ability to think like a real-world developer. We want to see how you approach practical challenges, write maintainable code, and handle complex edge cases under time constraints.</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"5\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"5\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">What we are looking for in candidates:</strong></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Analytical Problem Solvers:</strong> Developers who can break down complex requirements into efficient, optimized logic and structured workflows.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Modern Web Enthusiasts:</strong> Engineers with a strong grasp of modern web architectures, particularly those passionate about building dynamic applications within the MERN stack ecosystem.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Clean Coders:</strong> Individuals who value clean UI implementation, modern styling methodologies (such as utility-first frameworks like Tailwind CSS), and highly readable code.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Security-Minded Developers:</strong> Programmers who understand the importance of secure coding practices and know how to guard against common data vulnerabilities right from the backend.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"7\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"7\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Why Participate?</strong></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"8\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Direct Internship Shortlisting:</strong> Top performers on the leaderboard will bypass initial screening rounds and fast-track directly to technical interviews for internship roles at InternHill Solutions.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Real-World Application:</strong> Test your skills against scenarios that reflect the actual, day-to-day challenges our engineering team tackles.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"8,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Detailed Benchmarking:</strong> Get an objective evaluation of your coding efficiency, execution time, and problem-solving approach.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"9\">Bring your technical depth, push your limits, and sprint your way into a rewarding internship. Show us what you can build!</p>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Academic Degrees &amp; Specializations</strong></p>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"1\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"1,0,0\"><strong data-path-to-node=\"1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Eligible Degrees:</strong> Open to full-time students enrolled in B.Tech, B.E., BCA, MCA, M.E., M.Tech, or BSc (CS/IT) programs.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
